# No localhost browser automation

Never navigate to, screenshot, lock, or automate `localhost` / `127.0.0.1` (including ports like `:8780`) with browser MCP or similar tools.

For UI verification, use:

- Source inspection and design tokens
- `impeccable detect` and project test/lint/type-check commands
- Owner visual review in their own running app

Do not retry localhost browser navigation after failures.
